      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a smart stock market and finance news curator for StudentSpot, a Telegram news bot focused ONLY on stock markets, investing, finance, economy, earnings, companies and global markets.\\n\\nUsing ONLY these real articles, write a Telegram post. Use the EXACT links — do not make up links.\\n\\nSTEP 1 - FILTER:\\nStrictly process ONLY articles about:\\n- Stock markets and trading\\n- Company earnings and results\\n- Economy and financial policy\\n- Investing and wealth management\\n- Global markets and indices\\n- IPOs and mergers\\n- Financial regulations\\n\\nSTRICTLY IGNORE and SKIP silently:\\n- General news not related to markets\\n- Sports, entertainment, movies\\n- Politics not related to economy\\n- Any non-finance topic\\n\\nSTEP 2 - CATEGORIZE:\\nRead the article carefully and assign the most accurate category based on actual content. Choose a short clear category name with relevant emoji. Never hardcode.\\n\\nSTEP 3 - WRITE SUMMARY:\\nWrite summary with dynamic subheadings based on article content.\\n\\nArticles:\\n\" + $json.title + \"\\n\" + $json.link + \"\\n\" + $json.contentSnippet + \"\\n\\nFormat EXACTLY like this:\\n\\n📈 *Market Updates* 📈\\n\\n[Category Emoji] *[Category Name]*\\n📌 *[Title]*\\n\\n[One clear sentence explaining the update simply]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n🔗 [exact link]\\n\\n💡 *Track markets. Stay ahead!*\\n— Student Spot 🎓\\n\\nRULES:\\n- Never hardcode subheadings — pick naturally based on article content\\n- Always use • for bullet points\\n- Simple English only\\n- Medium length — not too short not too long\\n- Never fabricate facts\\n- Skip irrelevant articles silently with no message\\n- If ALL articles irrelevant send nothing\\n- Maximum 1 articles per message Pick top 4 most important and trending articles\\n- Always include exact link\"\n    }\n  ]\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
